{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e0ff865f-74fe-4d12-a78e-8dd9da31c246",
    "name": "Green Juice Hub API - BVA Collection",
    "description": "Collection rieng cho cac test case Boundary Value Analysis (BVA) thuoc Task QLPT-281 (nguoi phu trach: Hien) - Sprint 4, gom 2 Subtask: [QLPT-286](https://hientm0978.atlassian.net/browse/QLPT-286) BVA so dien thoai (users.phone / addresses.phone) va [QLPT-287](https://hientm0978.atlassian.net/browse/QLPT-287) BVA ma OTP (do dai + het han).\n\n## Chay nhanh\n1. Backend chay local tai `http://localhost:8081`, DB da co seed data (`database/seed.sql`).\n2. Import collection nay (da tu chua bien can thiet, khong can Environment rieng).\n3. Chay `00 - Setup` truoc (lay access_token cho nhom 02).\n4. Chay lan luot `01`, `02`, `03`. Cac case trong `03` co tien to `MANUAL-` can thao tac tay (xem console log server de lay ma OTP that, dat bien `runManualOtpCases=true`).\n5. Sau khi kiem tra xong nhom `02`, co the chay `99 - Optional Cleanup` (dat `runCleanup=true`) de xoa cac address test, tranh vuot qua gioi han 5 dia chi/user.\n\n## Phat hien quan trong da ap dung vao test case (xem chi tiet trong Claude Project, doc Sprint4-BVA-Testing.md muc 6)\n- Rang buoc `users.phone` la REGEX `^(0[3|5|7|8|9])+([0-9]{8})$` qua `/auth/send-otp`, KHONG phai do dai 1-15.\n- Rang buoc `addresses.phone` la REGEX KHAC: `^(0|\\+84)[0-9]{8,10}$`, bien la so chu so SAU TIEN TO (8-10).\n- `otp_verifications.otp_code` khong co @Size, luon so sanh bang gia tri that (equals) - case 'sai do dai' thuc chat la 'sai gia tri'.\n- Dau `+` trong regex send-otp co the cho phep lap nhom dau so - xem case `PHONE-REG-BUG-01` (nghi van bug).",
